<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch 5.75 pct Feb 2007 bond raises NLG 7.5 bln.</title>
<headline>Dutch 5.75 pct Feb 2007 bond raises NLG 7.5 bln.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Details of the following issue were announced by the Dutch Finance Ministry:</p>
<p>ISSUER: STATE OF THE NETHERLANDS</p>
<p>MATURITY: 15 FEB 2007</p>
<p>COUPON: 5.75 PCT</p>
<p>AMOUNT RAISED: 7.5 BILLION GUILDERS</p>
<p>AVERAGE YIELD: 5.64 PCT</p>
<p>AVERAGE ISSUE PRICE: 100.85</p>
<p>PAYMENT FREQUENCY: ANNUAL</p>
<p>NOTES - Bond was issued by means of tap sales held from Jan 20 to Jan 22.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
